          "author": "KIDZ BOP Kids",
          "description": "The album that started it all is back and bigger than ever! To celebrate KIDZ BOP’s 20th birthday, they’ve reached into the vault and re-recorded the original album of Y2K classics. KIDZ BOP 1 (20th Birthday Edition) includes “I Want It That Way,” “What A Girl Wants,” “Bye Bye Bye,” “Oops!…I Did It Again,” and many more! Relive the songs that defined a generation or enjoy them for the first time – THESE are the songs that everyone loves to sing along to!",
